(text "05 Sine reconstruction and series AM modulator" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "14bc022e-f195-50db-85b0-4ab4ec6be561"))
(text "True AM: within SLOT the carrier is continuous; KEY selects filtered sine or carrier-only reference.\nThe controller supplies coherent LEVEL_PWM and AF_PWM (carrier offset plus sine), default800Hz. No ESP32-S3 internal DAC assumed." (at 18 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f1c0a397-5f61-5547-9f16-60140d30ab89"))
